{'symbol': 'FE', 'date': '2022-10-03 11:32:00', 'title': 'POTOMAC EDISON PLANNING TO BUILD NEW SUBSTATION AT FREDERICK DATA CAMPUS', 'text': "NEW TRANSMISSION PROJECT WILL SUPPORT FIRST PHASE OF QUANTUM FREDERICK WILLIAMSPORT, MD. , OCT. 3, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- POTOMAC EDISON, A SUBSIDIARY OF FIRSTENERGY CORP. (NYSE: FE), HAS BEGUN PLANNING A NEW HIGH-VOLTAGE TRANSMISSION SUBSTATION THAT WILL PROVIDE POWER FOR THE FIRST PHASE OF QUANTUM FREDERICK, QUANTUM LOOPHOLE'S 2,100-ACRE DATA CENTER CAMPUS UNDER DEVELOPMENT IN FREDERICK, MARYLAND."}